# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ALLOWLIST gitignore (fail-closed). This repo is PUBLIC, so we ignore
# EVERYTHING by default and explicitly un-ignore only the integration surface.
# Anything that lands in this folder by mistake — a PRD, BRIEF, CLAUDE.md,
# AGENTS.md, a real .env, a company-registration doc, an internal runbook —
# is ignored automatically and can never be committed/published.
#
# To add a NEW intended public file, add an explicit `!/path` line below.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/*

# the only things allowed in this public repo:
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/llms.txt
!/openapi.yaml
!/LICENSE
!/examples/
/examples/*
!/examples/*.md
# Claude Agent Skill — allow ONLY the skill file, nothing else under skills/
!/skills/
/skills/*
!/skills/pairoa/
/skills/pairoa/*
!/skills/pairoa/SKILL.md

# extra belt-and-suspenders: even if un-ignored above, never these
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
